<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:31,770 --> 00:01:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way that I alone can
lose in a place like this!</font>

39
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:39,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei... please allow it.</font>

40
00:01:40,030 --> 00:01:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is now...</font>

41
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:54,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A time to carry through and protect
one's own Ninja Way!</font>

42
00:01:54,670 --> 00:02:00,720
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Ahh, Rock Lee!</font>

43
00:01:54,670 --> 00:02:00,720
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">This is How a</font>

44
00:01:54,670 --> 00:02:00,720
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Man Should be!!</font>

45
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The color of his body changed...!</font>

46
00:02:06,060 --> 00:02:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's red...?!</font>

47
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up with him...?!</font>

48
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's opened the third gate,
the Gate of Life...</font>

49
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's going to make his move!</font>

50
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, not yet!</font>

51
00:02:25,950 --> 00:02:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

52
00:02:30,670 --> 00:02:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also,</font>

53
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the fourth gate,
the Gate of Pain... open!</font>

54
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an incredible guy...</font>

55
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:46,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not as though effort alone
can make this happen...</font>

56
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy...</font>

57
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is he in fact a genius...?</font>

58
00:03:02,370 --> 00:03:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fast!</font>

59
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:07,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Gaara!
— Where are they?!</font>

60
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's above!</font>

61
00:03:15,670 --> 00:03:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we can't find Lee!</font>

62
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where?!</font>

63
00:03:24,970 --> 00:03:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sand isn't keeping up at all!</font>

64
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's the Sand Armor again...?</font>

65
00:03:39,110 --> 00:03:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then how's this?!</font>

66
00:03:51,330 --> 00:03:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

67
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Sand Armor is...</font>

68
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">being peeled away...!</font>

69
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:03,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a stubborn one.</font>

70
00:04:05,090 --> 00:04:06,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it comes to this...</font>

71
00:04:11,390 --> 00:04:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The muscles have torn...</font>

72
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that really Lee...?</font>

73
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did he become like this...?</font>

74
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the end!</font>

75
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fifth Gate of Closing... open!</font>

76
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't defend myself...</font>

77
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this the movement of
a human being?!</font>

78
00:04:37,290 --> 00:04:38,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji...</font>

79
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This technique is my ace in
the hole to take you down...</font>

80
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I will specially show it to you!</font>

81
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:48,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

82
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:06,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand Shield can't keep up!</font>

83
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:08,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most of the armor has also
been peeled off...</font>

84
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's done for!</font>

85
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow!</font>

86
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:14,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Lotus... In other words...</font>

87
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a high-speed continuous
Taijutsu that can't even be touched!</font>

88
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:21,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The answer to take Neji down is
that high speed combination...</font>

89
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way that
the sand can keep up!</font>

90
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This technique will be the last!</font>

91
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Lotus!</font>

92
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see anything, it's too fast...</font>

93
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible...</font>

94
00:05:59,670 --> 00:06:01,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The gourd has turned to sand...?</font>

95
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's done it this time!</font>

96
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:12,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara!</font>

97
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san...</font>

98
00:06:19,350 --> 00:06:20,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

99
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's... that?</font>

100
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He protects himself...</font>

101
00:06:40,370 --> 00:06:42,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using a gourd made of sand?!</font>

102
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That technique is...!</font>

103
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

104
00:07:21,830 --> 00:07:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

105
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got hit by the Hidden Lotus</font>

106
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and is still able to bring
forth a technique...!</font>

107
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

108
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:50,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just can not lose in a place like this...</font>

109
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to...</font>

110
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:56,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my Ninja Way...</font>

111
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

112
00:08:09,090 --> 00:08:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

113
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

114
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... save him?</font>

115
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's...</font>

116
00:09:05,900 --> 00:09:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm all right!</font>

117
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm strong so...</font>

118
00:09:09,690 --> 00:09:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin Exam...</font>

119
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei, please watch
me with a smile...</font>

120
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to prove that I could
become a respectable Ninja</font>

121
00:09:17,110 --> 00:09:19,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I can't use Ninjutsu!</font>

122
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:22,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be the ultimate for me!</font>

123
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:25,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is...</font>

124
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an important subordinate
whom I care for!</font>

125
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A subordinate... whom I care for...?</font>

126
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those words are definitely
not understandable to Gaara...</font>

127
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I quit...</font>

128
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He quit...?</font>

129
00:10:06,410 --> 00:10:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The moment Guy jumped in,
Lee lost.</font>

130
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner...</font>

131
00:10:15,170 --> 00:10:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaa-!</font>

132
00:10:16,470 --> 00:10:17,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Wha...?
— Huh?</font>

133
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:19,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— Huh?</font>

134
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

135
00:10:32,270 --> 00:10:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's impossible...</font>

136
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having opened the fifth gate...</font>

137
00:10:52,290 --> 00:10:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And his hand and feet are crushed...</font>

138
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way he should
be able to stand...!</font>

139
00:10:59,090 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

140
00:11:00,130 --> 00:11:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right.</font>

141
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over!</font>

142
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in no condition to stand...!</font>

143
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

144
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You...</font>

145
00:11:14,690 --> 00:11:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are...</font>

146
00:11:24,530 --> 00:11:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even after having
lost consciousness...</font>

147
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still want to prove your
own Ninja Way...?</font>

148
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he had already...</font>

149
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">lost consciousness...</font>

150
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

151
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're already...</font>

152
00:11:54,770 --> 00:11:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a respectable Ninja...!</font>

153
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner...</font>

154
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara.</font>

155
00:12:17,710 --> 00:12:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Lee-san!
— Sakura!</font>

156
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you went down
what could you do?</font>

157
00:12:28,850 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your words of encouragement
would only make him feel worse.</font>

158
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:48,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way he could
have beaten Gaara...</font>

159
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was faced with a tougher battle
than we thought...</font>

160
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...</font>

161
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow lost
to a guy like this...!</font>

162
00:13:17,810 --> 00:13:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Medics, please hurry.</font>

163
00:13:26,070 --> 00:13:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow...</font>

164
00:13:33,660 --> 00:13:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee-san...</font>

165
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the Jonin in charge of him,
aren't you?</font>

166
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes.</font>

167
00:14:01,570 --> 00:14:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come with me
for a minute.</font>

168
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Careful...</font>

169
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:11,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't shake him.</font>

170
00:14:26,260 --> 00:14:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is faint breathing...</font>

171
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:31,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but because of comminuted fractures
and muscle tears to his entire body,</font>

172
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:35,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">recovery will likely take
quite some time...</font>

173
00:14:39,190 --> 00:14:41,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that was all, it wouldn't be so bad, but...</font>

174
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:50,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The damage to the left arm
and leg which received the attack is severe...</font>

175
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:52,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too severe...</font>

176
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...!</font>

177
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:02,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to say this,</font>

178
00:15:04,420 --> 00:15:08,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he won't be able to...
live as a Shinobi again.</font>

179
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:22,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That...</font>

180
00:15:23,020 --> 00:15:25,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that can't be true...</font>

181
00:15:25,610 --> 00:15:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take Bushy Brow down.</font>

182
00:15:28,740 --> 00:15:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is not you whom I want to fight,
it's Uchiha!</font>

183
00:15:34,870 --> 00:15:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

184
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, I get where you're
coming from, believe me.</font>

185
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But all fighting must be done
officially in a match!</font>

186
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The failure beats the gifted genius
through sheer effort...</font>

187
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wouldn't that make for
an exciting main battle?</font>

188
00:15:50,590 --> 00:15:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though, I am probably going
to be the one fighting Neji...</font>

189
00:15:58,140 --> 00:15:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

190
00:15:59,930 --> 00:16:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't want to think... that you'd lose.</font>

191
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to let you fulfill...</font>

192
00:16:09,190 --> 00:16:10,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your Ninja Way!</font>

193
00:16:12,570 --> 00:16:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yay!</font>

194
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:15,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally mastered it!</font>

195
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yahoo!</font>

196
00:16:17,870 --> 00:16:19,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This technique...</font>

197
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after all, only Lee managed to master...</font>

198
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, you became Genin
from today.</font>

199
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to hear what it is
you all are aiming for!</font>

200
00:16:31,090 --> 00:16:35,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'd like to prove that I can become
a respectable Ninja</font>

201
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though I can't use
Ninjutsu or Genjutsu!</font>

202
00:16:39,970 --> 00:16:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That would be the ultimate for me!</font>

203
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:46,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive me for not...</font>

204
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stopping it...!</font>

205
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

206
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not true... it's not true.</font>

207
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After hearing that,
what should Bushy Brow do...?!</font>

208
00:17:03,790 --> 00:17:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

209
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said the failure would take
down a genius with effort...!</font>

210
00:17:10,050 --> 00:17:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't there something that
can be done?!</font>

211
00:17:13,970 --> 00:17:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Naruto.</font>

212
00:17:16,430 --> 00:17:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But... Kakashi-sensei!</font>

213
00:17:19,010 --> 00:17:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He kept saying he wanted
to battle Sasuke and Neji!</font>

214
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps... that led to his ruin.</font>

215
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To fulfill that dream...</font>

216
00:17:30,650 --> 00:17:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the boy even used a self-sacrificing
forbidden technique to try to win!</font>

217
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The result is what you see...</font>

218
00:17:47,870 --> 00:17:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy...</font>

219
00:17:49,670 --> 00:17:51,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke and Neji...</font>

220
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you...</font>

221
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he sacrificed himself to
a promise he never spoke of.</font>

222
00:17:58,090 --> 00:17:59,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He risked his life...</font>

223
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:03,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that he might have
a chance to battle you guys...</font>

224
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:11,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't forget that...</font>

225
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Lee-san...</font>

226
00:18:21,490 --> 00:18:22,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will be all right...?</font>

227
00:18:28,370 --> 00:18:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...</font>

228
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't realize it even at the end...</font>

229
00:18:34,590 --> 00:18:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heaven does not allow it.</font>

230
00:18:36,170 --> 00:18:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One who tries to move ahead
while achieving victory</font>

231
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">through a method like dying
upon each other's swords.</font>

232
00:19:00,070 --> 00:19:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it ended without incident...</font>

233
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome back, Gaara.</font>

234
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy...</font>

235
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

236
00:19:27,430 --> 00:19:29,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I spoke self-importantly earlier but...</font>

237
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've thought about it and
had I been in your position...</font>

238
00:19:35,730 --> 00:19:39,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I probably... wouldn't have
been able to stop him.</font>

239
00:19:45,370 --> 00:19:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy.</font>

240
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're in the way of the
next tournament... let's go up.</font>

241
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:54,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right...</font>

242
00:20:00,970 --> 00:20:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, the tenth and final round is next,
both contestants come forward!</font>

243
00:20:08,430 --> 00:20:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's finally my turn...</font>

244
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna win and have
some BBQ beef!</font>

245
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case, I need to last until
the main tournament and battle Sasuke-kun.</font>

246
00:20:23,820 --> 00:20:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or I will not have met your expectations,
Orochimaru-sama...</font>

247
00:20:29,410 --> 00:20:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can almost see through it...</font>

248
00:20:32,910 --> 00:20:35,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason that you went to the trouble
of getting to Sasuke-kun before us and...</font>

249
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">putting a Curse Mark on him
without killing him...</font>

250
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

251
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we were the guinea pigs to measure
Sasuke-kun's abilities during the examinations.</font>

252
00:20:47,050 --> 00:20:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you wanted isn't Sasuke-kun's life,
but Sasuke-kun himself...</font>

253
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Kinuta Dosu</font></font></b></font>

254
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Choji Akamichi</font></font></b></font>

255
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was also taken for a fool..</font>

256
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:02,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let the tenth round begin.</font>

257
